      "question": "<ol class=\"parts\"><li>Find, in ascending powers of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\"></span>, the first four terms of the binomial expansion of<div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(1-9x)^{\\frac{1}{2}}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>giving each term in simplest form.</p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li>Give a reason why <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\dfrac{2}{9}\"></span> should <strong>not</strong> be used in the expansion to find an approximation to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt3\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></li></ol>",
