      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-01-2024-june/q11",
      "question": "<figure class=\"practice-figure\" style=\"max-width:85mm;margin:2mm auto\"><img src=\"resources/exams/edexcel-9ma0-01-2024-june/q11-figure.svg\" alt=\"Figure 4. Semicircle ABCOA with centre O on diameter AC. Arc OB has centre A. Region R, between arc OB, arc BC and line OC, is shaded.\"></figure><p>Figure 4 shows the design of a badge.</p><p>The shape <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"ABCOA\"></span> is a semicircle with centre <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span> and diameter <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"10\\,\\mathrm{cm}\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"OB\"></span> is the arc of a circle with centre <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span> and radius <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5\\,\\mathrm{cm}\"></span>.</p><p>The region <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"R\"></span>, shown shaded in Figure 4, is bounded by the arc <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"OB\"></span>, the arc <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"BC\"></span> and the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"OC\"></span>.</p><p>Find the exact area of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"R\"></span>.</p><p>Give your answer in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left(a\\sqrt3+b\\pi\\right)\\mathrm{cm}^2\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span> are rational numbers.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></p>",
